{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "c5535d414304e1293e3aac34fa7903e1dab2dec419667269a833f404890e0af5", "ja": "※このワニは演出です※", "zh": "※这只鳄鱼只是演出效果※", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "798d4e674667e33395d667ba98a155ede12370c002e155e6e4777a2ce429cc6e", "ja": "『水上25m走』で、水中に用意されたワニに\n驚くアイドルたち。演出用の動く作り物だと\n説明され、紬は安心してスタートするが、\nこっそり亜美と真美に改造されていたワニは\n容赦なく紬に襲い掛かる。", "zh": "在“水上25米赛跑”中，偶像们被水中准备的鳄鱼吓了一跳。得知那是用于演出的会动道具后，紬放心地开始起跑，但被亜美和真美偷偷改造过的鳄鱼毫不留情地向紬扑去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_04_1000_041fuk", "source_sha256": "cbd6b1a852426698cb5a582108f31e8ce00f0f98b2921a03bdcb3bd3d3564e21", "ja": "ね、ねえ茜ちゃん、紬ちゃん。あれ、なんだと思う？\nプールの中で動いてる、ワニみたいな、黒い影……。", "zh": "那、那个……小茜、紬。你觉得那是什么？在泳池里动来动去、像鳄鱼一样的黑影……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_04_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "862f38385597dd74737d8ea19f8db5113a69bb0168b3b3ae26f10cecf98a43d6", "ja": "んー？　あれは……うん、ワニだね！\nもしかして{$P$}ちゃんの演出かな？", "zh": "嗯——？那个是……嗯，是鳄鱼呢！  \n难道是{$P$}的演出？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_04_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7037f01223eedad0d3d99e7836d6325a430d9ca917b9835dfc8d1905cca9ba94", "ja": "ああ、水に落ちたら負けになる理由がほしかったんだ。\nこういうのは雰囲気作りも大事だから。", "zh": "啊，我是想找个掉进水里就算输的理由。\n这种事情，营造气氛也很重要嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_04_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "211c4414d0806b41629a60b736768092c6789bc7fe8c2b6565462b1ddf85f005", "ja": "雰囲気……では、あれは作り物、でいいのですか？\nその……動いているように、見えるのですが……？", "zh": "氛围……那么，那个是做出来的东西，对吗？\n那个……看起来好像在动……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_04_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "a3d58e6d5bd0ec7423e02ea8652f44a5d475aa19ec35a9fdbbb420000a1c7b52", "ja": "いや～、つむりん心配し過ぎじゃない？　さすがに\n本物なワケないよね、{$P$}ちゃん♪", "zh": "不是吧～，阿紬你也太担心了！再怎么说，也不可能是真的，对吧，{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_04_1005_wani", "source_sha256": "38c78179237250fa93356845b34ca64fc641b48079fb15f46932bbae6a98203c", "ja": "ヴオオオオオオオッ！！", "zh": "呜哦哦哦哦哦哦哦哦！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_04_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "b15b476197f24ea91d22fd04515618ad3b38c39b4f6babfb2dbc8fc2b2f72707", "ja": "本物だーーーーっ！！！！", "zh": "是真的————！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_04_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "24ab77f3114a36da7dddb8825fac87c314c28b16e6e4b709f50072636b5ac5a7", "ja": "本物なのではぁっ！！？？", "zh": "该不会是真的吧——！！？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_04_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1fa5cbf8e633d44c66c48c3ad56a92dfcc267d84cb753ed185886c7311ccdd41", "ja": "本物だぁ～～～っ！！！！", "zh": "是真的呀～～～！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_04_1009_p", "source_sha256": "43869e880572658f341893cf0dac7b7b72fa7e45c66212e3772ddd87368dff0e", "ja": "ははっ、まさか！　間違いなく作り物のワニだよ。\nロコがいじって、少し動くようにしてくれたんだ。", "zh": "哈哈，怎么可能！这绝对是仿制的鳄鱼啦。\n是ROCO动了点手脚，让它能稍微动一动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_04_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8f1eb7ab72a81ad3d086905520151504460f66cd36881cd8eb19cdeed001442a", "ja": "そ、そうだったんですか……。もう、どうして先に\n言ってくれないんです？　イジワルなんだから。", "zh": "原、原来是这样啊……真是的，为什么不早点告诉我呢？太坏心眼了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_04_1011_p", "source_sha256": "9870b0365298e3eef6de7818a4397b87c321fa3dcc55c76a6c148894497d6160", "ja": "ごめんごめん。ということで、紬も安心して位置に\nついてくれ。次の水上25m走、第一走者だよな？", "zh": "抱歉抱歉。那么，紬也放心地去各就各位吧。下一场水上25米赛跑，你是第一棒吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_04_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "71f3a6fc9c20c3a88a222f59f656b4680a1bf3c5d3528f40414bb6209822f494", "ja": "まったく、人が悪いとはこのことです……。\nとにかく、わかりました、行ってまいります。", "zh": "真是的，您可真够坏心眼的……\n总之，我知道了，我这就去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_04_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "cfae476b355c000a889dfad853c3e34006022c099f059a83cad123d0a8f2b79c", "ja": "『水上25m走』、第一走者は白石選手です！\n位置について、よーい……ドーン！", "zh": "“水上25米赛跑”，第一棒是白石选手！\n各就各位，预备……跑！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_04_1014_wani", "source_sha256": "31322ef3fe2af55b943fdec1daec3e1a51e148b57eba15fe282871f96a4ea3c7", "ja": "グアアアァァヴオオオォォッ！！！！\nバシャバシャバシャバシャッ！！！！", "zh": "咕啊啊啊啊呜哦哦哦哦！！！！\n哗啦哗啦哗啦哗啦！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_04_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c0df03dd946b52e1e93984d6f0c95ed3dd4226ce13ffa79af4b2c8f7e7c2f7b5", "ja": "きいいぃぃやああぁぁぁぁっ！！！！", "zh": "啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_04_1016_audience", "source_sha256": "6ff5d451398464ffc4ad78b192ab66e389f5de7e6596f804392fe8108ab10018", "ja": "ウワアアアアァァァァァァッ！！！！", "zh": "呜哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_04_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "80f07295a3f12ed5c1bd1697dd6972310d7502e7f7e670165a0f77f5fad46933", "ja": "ちょっ、{$P$}ちゃん！？\nワニがものすごい勢いで動いてるんですけどーっ！？", "zh": "等、等一下，{$P$}！？\n鳄鱼动得也太快了吧——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_04_1018_p", "source_sha256": "66d45acdaac1b824c1c00ed39a8b6fcc14176ba3bd8009cc9a96f6ac73d3b065", "ja": "い、いや！？　あそこまでの機能は\nつけてないはず……！？", "zh": "不、不对吧！？应该没加过\n那么夸张的功能才对……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_04_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9d3bf1dcc41a13276162d6d212130e41791589b5e63fc5cf05438d5952ce4e9f", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　\nあっちにハイタッチしてる亜美ちゃんと真美ちゃんが！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！　\n那边有正在击掌的亚美和真美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_04_1020_p", "source_sha256": "2504ee93268381ac7a84bd80dddcac3b27b6aa6a8d1c0b22f13a0b899e3a8ae7", "ja": "しまった！！　二人がさらに改造してたのか……！\nすまん紬、逃げ切ってくれ！　ちょっと行ってくる！！", "zh": "糟了！！原来她们两个又进一步改造了吗……！\n抱歉，紬，你快逃吧！我去去就来！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_04_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "f9a07eaea5690cac115abd93f880579b819f7126f8f3da3ccb5dc3a60d0db7b1", "ja": "が、頑張れつむりん！　生きてーーーっ！！\n……あっ。", "zh": "可、可要加油啊，小紬！一定要活下来——！\n……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_04_1022_se", "source_sha256": "844b11d520a24c6613c3d164e9b2f90ec7fc95ca97858bb969168be8d6f4bb01", "ja": "バッシャーン！", "zh": "哗啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
